Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《纳尼亚传奇2: 凯斯宾王子》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毛巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Towels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米拉兹阁下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Miraz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上天保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heavens have blessed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道怎么做了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know your orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛洛塞将军?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Glozelle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再睡五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不去看星星了 王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't be watching the stars tonight, my prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们得快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. We must hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 老师 发生了什么事? - 你的婶婶刚生了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Professor, what's going on? - Your aunt has given birth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…一个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得逃到森林里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must make for the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 森林? - 他们不会追到那的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The woods? - They won't follow you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了很多年才找到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has taken me many years to find this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不到紧急时刻千万不要用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not use it except at your greatest need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还会见面吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will I ever see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望有那么一天 王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dearly hope so, my prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有很多事要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is so much more I meant to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你所知道的一切将会改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you know is about to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起吊桥！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the drawbridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 站住！ - 站住！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Halt! - Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个儿子！一个儿子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A son! A son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普鲁娜瑞丝米亚夫人今晚 为米拉兹阁下生了个儿子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Prunaprismia has this night given Lord Miraz a son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这群老迷信 今晚想在牢里过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which of you superstitious old women wants to spend the night in a cell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看见我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's seen us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小心点 宝贝 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind yourself, love. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着点路！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch where you're going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去圣芬巴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go to Saint Finbar's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去亨顿屋 就在马路对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go to Hendon House. Across the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总见你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…一个人坐着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sitting by yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我喜欢一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, I prefer to be left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 菲利斯 - 苏珊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Phyllis. - Susan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better come quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖报！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paper here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的报纸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your daily paper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃德蒙！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edmund!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快！打他脸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on! Kick him in the face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 别打了 够了 别打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it. Break it up. That's enough. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都几岁了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Act your age!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不用谢 - 我应付得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're welcome. - I had it sorted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次又怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他撞了我 - 就为这你要打他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He bumped me. - So you hit him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 他撞了我 却要我道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. After he bumped me, they tried to make me apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 所以我才打他的 - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's when I hit him. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 退让就那么难吗? - 又不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it that hard just to walk away? - I shouldn't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 老是被当成小孩子 你们就不觉得烦吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, don't you ever get tired of being treated like a kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I wasn't always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经一年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还要我们等多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long does he expect us to wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该认清现实了 我们就生活在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time to accept that we live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假装不同也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no use pretending any different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 假装跟我说话 - 我们本来就在跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pretend you're talking to me. - We are talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 安静 露 - 有东西掐我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quiet, Lu. - Something pinched me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别拽了！ - 我没碰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop pulling! - Not touching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你们刚刚…那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, would all of you just... What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像魔法一样 - 大家拉起手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It feels like magic. - Everyone hold hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我才不要拉你的手！ - 快…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not holding your hand! - Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:12:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没我快 真羞 埃德！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame you're not as quick as me, Ed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最慢的人是臭蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last one in's a rotten egg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 苏珊 快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Susan. Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 好漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃德蒙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edmund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃德?埃德！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed? Ed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么? - 我们在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - Where do you suppose we are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, where do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得纳尼亚有废墟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't remember any ruins in Narnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会是谁住在这呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonder who lived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 那是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的国际象棋 - 什么国际象棋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From my chess set. - Which chess set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在芬奇利可没有纯金象棋 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't exactly have a solid gold chess set in Finchley, did I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没发觉吗? - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you see? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一下 墙壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lmagine walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柱子 就在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And columns, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有玻璃屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a glass roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔帕斯维尔城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cair Paravel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等一下 阁下 并不是你想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait, my lord. It is not what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么是怎样呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not exactly sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过元老会 信任米拉兹阁下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned this council when it put its trust in Lord Miraz...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 会有严重后果 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- there would be consequences. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有证据 我们不能指控护国公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't accuse the Lord Protector without proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要用那个借口多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long are we going to hide behind that excuse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到这里的席位都空了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until every chair in this chamber is empty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位元老 抱歉我来晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lords of the council, my apologies for being late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道要开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't aware we were in session.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问你有其他事忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you were otherwise occupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阁下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自凯斯宾九世陛下去世后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since the death of Caspian the ninth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就以国王自居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've behaved as if you were king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在在他保护的城堡里 连凯斯宾王子都失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it seems that from behind his walls even Prince Caspian has gone missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,致上我最深的同情 米拉兹阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My deepest condolences, Lord Miraz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想 你的侄子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine, losing your nephew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王位的合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rightful heir to the throne,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你夫人诞下一子的晚上失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the very night your wife has blessed you with a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 索普匹安大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Lord Sopespian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的同情在这种困难时刻 确实是最大的恩赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your compassion is a boon in this troubled time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你能告诉我们 悲剧是如何发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you can tell us how such a tragedy could have occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太令人气愤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the most disturbing news of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们敬爱的凯斯宾…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our beloved Caspian was abducted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…被纳尼亚人绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...by Narnians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太扯了 米拉兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go too far, Miraz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把这种恶行都推到神话故事上 指望我们会相信你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expect us to stand by while you blame such a blatant crime on fairy tales?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都忘了 大人们 纳尼亚曾是一片野蛮之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We forget, my lords, Narnia was once a savage land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凶猛的生物四处游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fierce creatures roamed free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了消灭这些害畜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much of our forefathers' blood was shed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的祖先流了多少血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to exterminate this vermin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or so we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但当我们在争论不休时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But while we've been bickering amongst ourselves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…他们却如石下蟑螂一样迅速繁殖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they've been breeding like cockroaches under a rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,壮大起来 时刻注视着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Growing stronger. Watching us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等待进攻的时机！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting to strike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道我们为什么不喜欢你嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wonder why we don't like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 我打算回击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I intend to strike back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使我必须砍倒整片森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I have to cut down the entire forest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我向你们保证 我会找到凯斯宾王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you, I will find Prince Caspian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并完成我们祖先的遗愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and finish what our ancestors began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抛石器 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catapults. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这发生很久了 卡尔帕斯维尔城堡受到了攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This didn't just happen. Cair Paravel was attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带了火柴吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't suppose you have any matches, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,……这个可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would this help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该早点说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might have mentioned that a bit sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信 所有东西还在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. It's all still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前那么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那时更老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you were older then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几百年后一切却倒过来了…你更年轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As opposed to hundreds of years later... when you're younger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么? - 我的号角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - My horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.05,0:22:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是回去的那天留在了马鞍上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must've left it on my saddle the day we went back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰露出牙齿 冬天就过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Aslan bares his teeth, winter meets its death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他抖抖鬃毛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he shakes his mane...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.99,0:23:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…春天就又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we shall have spring again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.63,0:23:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认识的人…杜纳先生和海狸一家…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone we knew... Mr. Tumnus and the Beavers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…都不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they're all gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.31,0:23:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去搞清楚发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time we found out what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直盯着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't stop staring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就别看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这够远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's far enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.35,0:24:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.69,0:24:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乌鸦与陶器！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crows and crockery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.83,0:25:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“放开他”！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Drop him"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只会说这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the best you can come up with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.57,0:25:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只需一句简单的“谢谢”就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple "thank you" would suffice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你们的帮忙 他们也能把我淹死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were doing fine drowning me without your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.71,0:25:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们该让他们那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should have let them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.41,0:25:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们为什么要杀你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why were they trying to kill you, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.29,0:25:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是台尔玛人 专干这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're Telmarines. That's what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,台尔玛人?在纳尼亚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telmarines? In Narnia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去几百年你们去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been for the last few hundred years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.70,0:25:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit of a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.81,0:25:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 在开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you've got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是过去的国王和女王?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the kings and queens of old?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.35,0:25:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至高王彼得 最伟大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High King Peter, the Magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以不用说后面那词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You probably could've left off the last bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.76,0:26:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.29,0:26:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你很惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might be surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.63,0:26:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想这么做的 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to do that, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我 是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me. Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃德蒙！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edmund!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.52,0:26:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.21,0:26:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡须与床架！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beards and bedsteads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.31,0:27:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许那个号角最后还是起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that horn worked after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么号角?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What horn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.07,0:27:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这面包不新鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bread is so stale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.01,0:27:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给他弄点汤 他很快会醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just get him some soup. He should be coming around soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.54,0:27:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我下手不重啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I hit him hard enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼卡布瑞克 他还是个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikabrik, he's just a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是台尔玛人 不是迷路的小狗 你说过你会干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Telmarine, not some lost puppy. You said you were gonna get rid of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我说我会照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I said I'd take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在不能杀他 我才包扎了他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't kill him now. I just bandaged his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.09,0:27:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在杀了他就像谋杀一个客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be like murdering a guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他的朋友又会怎么对待他们的客人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think his friends are treating their guest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.53,0:27:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,川卜金知道他做了什么 不是这孩子的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trumpkin knew what he was doing. It's not the boy's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.57,0:28:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下！停下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.74,0:28:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 不 不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it. No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说了 那时我们就应该先下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you we should have killed him when we had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我们不能 - 如果我们投票表决 我同意他说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know why we can't. - If we're taking a vote, I'm with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.32,0:28:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能放他走 他看到我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let him go. He's seen us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 尼卡布瑞克！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough, Nikabrik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我再坐到你头上吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do I have to sit on your head again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.93,0:28:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你 看看你都让我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you. Look what you made me do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.63,0:28:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了半个早上熬那个汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent half the morning on that soup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.43,0:28:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.23,0:28:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 你这么问很好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's funny that you would ask that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.60,0:28:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为人们看到一只獾 就知道是什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think people would know a badger when they saw one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.11,0:28:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 我是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…你们是纳尼亚人 你们应该灭绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're Narnians. You're supposed to be extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to disappoint you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.12,0:28:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你 还是热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. Still hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候开始 我们让台尔玛士兵寄宿在这了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when did we open a boarding house for Telmarine soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.13,0:28:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是凯斯宾王子 第十任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Prince Caspian. The tenth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.10,0:29:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.78,0:29:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叔叔一直想要我的王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My uncle has always wanted my throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能活到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose I have only lived this long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.28,0:29:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为他没有自己的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he did not have an heir of his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.32,0:29:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 情况改变了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that changes things. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着我们不必亲手杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means we don't have to kill you ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.73,0:29:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要去哪? - 我叔叔不杀了我不会善罢甘休的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - My uncle won't stop until I am dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能走 你是来救我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't leave. You're meant to save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.71,0:29:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这是什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.41,0:30:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的图书馆不错 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have quite a library, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您要找什么东西吗 阁下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything particular you seek, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.98,0:30:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已经找到了我想要的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I've already found what I'm looking for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.55,0:30:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…从我的一个士兵身上找到了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in one of my soldiers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.11,0:30:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道苏珊女王的号角吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know of Queen Susan's horn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说那是有魔法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was said to be magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.75,0:30:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.48,0:31:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳尼亚人相信它能召唤出 以前的国王和女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Narnians believed it could summon their kings and queens of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 这只是个迷信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, such was the superstition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那凯斯宾知道这个迷信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what does Caspian know of this superstition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阁下 你禁止我提及这些古老传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, you forbade me from mentioning the old tales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.07,0:31:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.85,0:31:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以这么说 如果凯斯宾 知道这些高深魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will say this. If Caspian does know of the Deep Magic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.09,0:31:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么阁下确实有理由紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my lord would have good reason to be nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先我们的王子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First our prince...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…现在他的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...now his tutor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:31:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果米拉兹家的人都不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the members of Miraz's own house are not safe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.91,0:32:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我们呢? - 索普匹安大人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- are any of us? - Lord Sopespian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说这些话很危险 索普匹安大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are dangerous words, Lord Sopespian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.35,0:32:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在是危急时期 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these are dangerous times, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.66,0:32:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话得跟交朋友一样慎重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One should choose his words as carefully as he chooses his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.13,0:32:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大桥什么时候造好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until the bridge is finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还在施工中 - 不如人意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Construction continues on schedule. - That's not good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.94,0:32:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要军队现在就渡河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need my army across that river now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以派些自己的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I suggest you contribute some of your own men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.51,0:32:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能调遣的就这么些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only so many at my disposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.28,0:32:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fact you'd be wise to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.39,0:32:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去贝鲁那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to Beruna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.05,0:32:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带够人 我们得在他们之前找到凯斯宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take as many troops as you need. We must get to Caspian before they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“他们” 阁下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They," my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.10,0:32:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该学学历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time you learned your history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.96,0:33:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们好安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're so still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.07,0:33:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是树 你还想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trees. What'd you expect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.07,0:33:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们以前会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们离开不久 台尔玛人就入侵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't long after you left that the Telmarines invaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.25,0:33:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活下来的都隐居到森林里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who survived retreated to the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而这些树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the trees,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.42,0:33:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隐居地太深 自那以后就没人提及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they retreated so deep into themselves that they haven't been heard from since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.16,0:33:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白 阿斯兰怎么会坐视不理呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. How could Aslan have let this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.26,0:33:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他和你们一样抛弃我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought he abandoned us when you lot did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.94,0:34:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们并不想离开的 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't mean to leave, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.41,0:34:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在又有什么分别 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes no difference now, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我们去找纳尼亚人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us to the Narnians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.91,0:34:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…会不一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.02,0:34:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.29,0:34:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我们是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. We're friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.68,0:35:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离她远点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.51,0:35:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射 苏珊！发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot, Susan! Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么他不停下? - 我想他饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why wouldn't he stop? - I suspect he was hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.85,0:35:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很凶悍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.12,0:36:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他不会说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he could talk at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.46,0:36:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被当成哑巴动物对待太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get treated like a dumb animal long enough,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就变成这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what you become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会发现纳尼亚 比你们想象中要野蛮地多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may find Narnia a more savage place than you remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.22,0:36:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.69,0:36:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得我们应该 等待国王和女王的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think we should wait for the kings and queens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.63,0:36:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好！去啊！看看其他人是否理解！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine! Go then! See if the others will be as understanding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.93,0:36:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我会和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe I'll come with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看看你怎么向牛头人解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see you explain things to the minotaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.77,0:36:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牛头人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minotaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.34,0:36:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.58,0:36:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脾气很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And very bad-tempered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.15,0:37:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 更不用说体型大 - 庞大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, not to mention big. - Huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.82,0:37:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那半人马人呢?他们还存在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about centaurs? Do they still exist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 半人马人也许会站在你那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the centaurs will probably fight on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不清楚其他人会怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no telling what the others will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.83,0:37:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.87,0:37:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道我们这么多事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know so much about us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 故事 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stories. - Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.21,0:37:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲跟你说过纳尼亚的故事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father told you stories about Narnia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.71,0:37:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是我的老师 他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my professor, he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.65,0:37:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.82,0:37:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些不是你们该问的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are not the kind of questions you should be asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.15,0:37:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - Human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.46,0:37:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他? - 不 他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Him? - No. Them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.66,0:37:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们在那！ - 快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There they are! - Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 不 - 等等 我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - Wait. I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.20,0:38:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着 走！它比我重要得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it. Go! It's more important than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.27,0:39:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带他离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.75,0:39:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想好了再说遗言 台尔玛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose your last words carefully, Telmarine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.27,0:39:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是只老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.37,0:39:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还指望有点新意呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping for something a little more original.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起你的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.05,0:39:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.41,0:39:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起来！我不会和手无寸铁的人决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it up! I will not fight an unarmed man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.75,0:39:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我选择不和你兵刃相交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I might live longer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.89,0:39:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我能活得更久点 尊敬的老鼠先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I choose not to cross blades with you, noble mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.79,0:39:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说了不会和你打 - 我没说过要放过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I would not fight you. I didn't say I'd let you live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷佩契普！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reepicheep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.13,0:40:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 收起你的剑！ - 特鲁佛汉特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay your blade! - Trufflehunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信你在这种不当时间打扰 一定有很好的理由吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you have a very good reason for this untimely interruption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.47,0:40:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他没有 继续 - 是他吹响了号角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He doesn't. Go ahead. - He's the one who blew the horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.87,0:40:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 让他拿出来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Then let him bring it forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.61,0:40:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是为此聚集在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the reason we have gathered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得这条路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你们女孩的问题 你们无法记住地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem with girls. You can't carry a map in your heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.76,0:40:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为我们记了其它事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because our heads have something in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.96,0:40:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他一开始就能听从D.L.F.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish he'd just listen to the D.L.F. In the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.63,0:40:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- D.L.F.? - 亲爱的小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- D.L. F? - Dear Little Friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.34,0:40:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那根本毫无帮助 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's not at all patronizing, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.88,0:40:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.18,0:40:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最后一次看到凯斯宾 是在恐怖的森林里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You last saw Caspian at the Shuddering Woods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去那最快的方法就是渡河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the quickest way there is to cross at the river Rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我搞错了 但这里不应该可以渡过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But unless I'm mistaken, there's no crossing in these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.19,0:41:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只能说明 是你搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That explains it, then. You're mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.02,0:41:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 随着时间 河水侵蚀了泥土 变得更深…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, over time, water erodes the earth's soil, carving deeper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.02,0:41:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.76,0:41:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有办法下去吗? - 有啊 跳下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there a way down? - Yeah, falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.06,0:41:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we weren't lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝鲁那附近有一个浅滩 游过去怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a ford near Beruna. How do you feel about swimming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.30,0:41:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游过去总比走过去好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather that than walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.64,0:41:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.64,0:41:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是阿斯兰！阿斯兰在那里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Aslan! It's Aslan over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.18,0:41:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们没看见吗?他就在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see? He's right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.18,0:42:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.25,0:42:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see him now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.62,0:42:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那 他要我们跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was there. He wanted us to follow him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.50,0:42:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这片森林里有许多狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure there are any number of lions in this wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像那只熊 - 我知道那就是阿斯兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like that bear. - I think I know Aslan when I see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.90,0:42:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我可不想跟着不存在的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not about to jump off a cliff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.57,0:42:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳下悬崖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after someone who doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.81,0:42:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次我没相信露西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I didn't believe Lucy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.28,0:42:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后以我的愚蠢收场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ended up looking pretty stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.62,0:42:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我就没看到他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't I have seen him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你没在看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you weren't looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.89,0:42:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Lu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.82,0:43:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.52,0:43:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 台尔玛人！ - 骗子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Telmarine! - Liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凶手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.69,0:43:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个号角只能证明 他们从我们这偷了另一样东西！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this horn proves is they've stolen yet another thing from us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.00,0:43:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我什么也没偷 - 没偷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't steal anything. - Didn't steal anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.96,0:43:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是不是该说下 台尔玛人从我们这夺走的东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we list the things the Telmarines have taken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.87,0:43:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们的家！ - 我们的土地！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our homes! - Our land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.57,0:43:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们的自由！ - 我们的生活！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our freedom! - Our lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.94,0:43:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们偷了纳尼亚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole Narnia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.17,0:43:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人民所犯的一切罪行 你们都要我负责吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would hold me accountable for all the crimes of my people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.54,0:43:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,负责…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accountable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.88,0:43:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…还有惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and punishable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.55,0:43:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为你们 矮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is rich coming from you, dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.98,0:43:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了 是你的人协助白雪女巫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you forgotten it was your people who fought alongside the White Witch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.12,0:43:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意再做一次 只要能让我们摆脱这些野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'd gladly do it again, if it would rid us of these barbarians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.99,0:43:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很幸运你无法带她回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's lucky that it is not in your power to bring her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你想让我们叫这男孩去对抗阿斯兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you suggesting that we ask this boy to go against Aslan now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.44,0:44:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们有些人都忘了 但我们獾却牢牢记着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of you may have forgotten, but we badgers remember well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.11,0:44:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有亚当之子成为国王 对纳尼亚才是最正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Narnia was never right except when a Son of Adam was king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.88,0:44:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是台尔玛人！ 为什么要让他当我们的国王?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Telmarine! Why would we want him as our king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.88,0:44:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我能帮助你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.82,0:44:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是个诡计！ - 先听他说完！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a trick! - At least hear him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.69,0:44:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这片森林之外 我是一个王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond these woods, I'm a prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.16,0:44:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,台尔玛王位的合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Telmarine throne is rightfully mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.03,0:44:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我收回王位 我能为你们带来和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me claim it, and I can bring peace between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.63,0:44:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的 时机成熟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is true. The time is ripe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watch the skies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.07,0:44:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如你记着历史一样 我也在时刻关注着 獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for it is mine to watch as it is yours to remember, badger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.28,0:44:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胜利之王塔瓦 还有和平女神阿兰比尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tarva, the lord of victory, and Alambil, the lady of peace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一同出现在天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have come together in the high heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.62,0:44:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此刻就在这里 亚当之子涌现了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now here, a Son of Adam has come forth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…带给我们久违的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to offer us back our freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.50,0:45:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能吗?你真的相信会有和平吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this possible? Do you really think there could be peace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.73,0:45:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信吗?我是说 你真的相信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you? I mean, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.47,0:45:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两天前 我不相信世上存在 会说话的动物…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days ago, I didn't believe in the existence of talking animals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.64,0:45:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…或是矮人…或是半人马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or dwarves... or centaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.98,0:45:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在你们就在这 这么多人 这么强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet here you are in strength and numbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.28,0:45:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们台尔玛人从未想到过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we Telmarines could never have imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.42,0:45:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论这只号角是否具有魔力 它把我们聚集到了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether this horn is magic or not, it brought us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.66,0:45:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.66,0:45:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有机会拿回属于我们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a chance to take back what is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你会带领我们 那么我的儿子们和我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you will lead us, then my sons and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.10,0:45:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…愿意为你拔剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...offer you our swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:46:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意无私地为你奉献我们的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we offer you our lives, unreservedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.19,0:46:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米拉兹的军队离我们不远了 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miraz's army will not be far behind us, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.03,0:46:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们准备迎击他们 我们得赶快找些士兵和武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are to be ready for them, we need to hurry to find soldiers and weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.27,0:46:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定他们很快就会来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they will be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.38,0:46:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些！还有这些！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These ones! And these ones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.09,0:46:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心树！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.86,0:46:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回来！ - 注意身后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get back! - Watch your back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.86,0:46:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.26,0:46:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 稳住 稳住！ - 树倒了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Steady, steady! - Timber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.22,0:47:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这不是最好的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps this wasn't the best way to come after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.98,0:47:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪看到阿斯兰了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where exactly do you think you saw Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.26,0:47:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你们都不要装大人说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd all stop trying to sound like grown-ups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是以为看到他 而是我确实看到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I saw him, I did see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.43,0:47:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个大人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a grown-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.40,0:47:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was right over...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.67,0:47:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.51,0:48:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.13,0:48:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西 你没睡着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy, are you awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.03,0:49:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你们认为我没看到阿斯兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think I didn't see Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.34,0:49:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.44,0:49:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 我们穿过了峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we got across the gorge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.12,0:49:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.05,0:49:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不是真的相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you didn't really want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.36,0:49:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直知道我们会回来 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always knew we'd be coming back here, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.50,0:49:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后我终于能接受在英国的事实了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally just got used to the idea of being in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.61,0:49:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你很高兴在这 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're happy to be here, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.91,0:49:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While it lasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.18,0:51:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.65,0:52:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.87,0:52:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you so much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.17,0:52:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你长大了 - 每年你都在长大…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've grown. - Every year you grow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.77,0:52:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so shall I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.68,0:52:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了?为什么你不来帮我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been? Why haven't you come to help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.18,0:52:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事不过二 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things never happen the same way twice, dear one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.20,0:52:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊！醒醒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan! Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.47,0:52:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 露 如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly, Lu. Whatever you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.69,0:53:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.74,0:53:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.02,0:54:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.64,0:54:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯宾王子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prince Caspian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.68,0:54:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的?你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? And who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.38,0:54:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.26,0:55:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 彼得至高王 - 我想你在叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- High King Peter. - I believe you called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.53,0:55:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是的 但…我觉得你应该老多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yes, but... I thought you'd be older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.90,0:55:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若你希望 我们可以几年后再来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you like, we could come back in a few years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.00,0:55:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 没关系 你只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, that's all right. You're just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.74,0:55:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我想的不大一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not exactly what I expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.84,0:55:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.41,0:55:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们共同的敌人 甚至集结了最古老的仇敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A common enemy unites even the oldest of foes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.35,0:55:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们焦急地等待您的归来 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have anxiously awaited your return, my liege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的心和剑随时供您差遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our hearts and swords are at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.06,0:55:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天哪 他太可爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh, he is so cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.93,0:55:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁在说? - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who said that? - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.86,0:55:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下 致上我最崇高的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty, with the greatest respect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.30,0:55:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信“勇气” “礼貌”或“风度”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do believe "courageous," "courteous," or "chivalrous"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.87,0:55:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更适合一个纳尼亚勇士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might more befit a knight of Narnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.14,0:55:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们知道你们中的一些还能拿动剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least we know some of you can handle a blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.38,0:55:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 确实如此 我最近找到了他们的用武之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, indeed. And I have recently put it to good use,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.48,0:55:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为您的军队守卫武器 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}securing weapons for your army, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.61,0:55:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 我们需要尽可能多的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Because we're going to need every sword we can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.95,0:56:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 也许你想拿回你的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, you will probably be wanting yours back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.04,0:56:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们拿走了多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did they take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.11,0:56:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够配备两个团的武器和盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough weapons and armor for two regiments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.65,0:56:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是…还不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... there's more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“害怕森林是对的”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You were right to fear the woods."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.52,0:56:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- “X”? - 凯斯宾 第十任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "X"? - Caspian. The tenth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.26,0:56:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 阁下 是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize, my lord. The blame is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.03,0:56:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.37,0:56:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 将军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, general...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.37,0:56:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…你们失去了多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how many men did you lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.77,0:56:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个也没有 阁下 - 一个也没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- None, my lord. - None?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.01,0:57:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们深夜潜入 我们根本就没看到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came like ghosts, in the dead of night. We never saw them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.02,0:57:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你如何解释你的伤?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how do you explain your injuries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是问…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.30,0:57:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…在纳尼亚人的这场血腥袭击中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how many men were killed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多少人被杀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during this bloody Narnian attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.87,0:57:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能活下来真是幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of which you were a fortunate survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.65,0:57:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.58,0:57:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.03,0:57:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 索普匹安大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize, Lord Sopespian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.98,0:58:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯宾不是这场野蛮暴乱的受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caspian is not a victim of this savage uprising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.02,0:58:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是煽动者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the instigator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.73,0:58:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来纳尼亚很需要一个新的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems Narnia is in need of a new king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.30,0:58:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有军队真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's good you have troops,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.47,0:58:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还需要些防御工事 一些准备瞄准的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we need some fortifications. Somewhere to train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.75,0:58:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么?他们怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? What are they like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.48,0:58:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不满 抱怨 固执 - 就如早晨的倔驴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcontents, complainers, stubborn as mules in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.76,0:58:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你喜欢他们咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you like them, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.96,0:58:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.11,1:00:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许和以前不一样了 但这还能防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may not be what you are used to, but it is defensible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.08,1:00:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 也许你想看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. You may want to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.36,1:00:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.83,1:00:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.27,1:00:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.84,1:02:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定知道自己在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must know what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.84,1:02:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在得靠我们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's up to us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是时间问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米拉兹的军队和战争机器已经在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miraz's men and war machines are on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.21,1:03:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说这些人不可能在守卫城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means those same men aren't protecting his castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.31,1:03:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您希望我们怎么做 陛下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you propose we do, Your Majesty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.12,1:03:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得做好准备 - 为了开始准备…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to get ready for it. - To start planning for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.29,1:03:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们唯一的希望就是先他们出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our only hope is to strike them before they strike us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.16,1:03:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疯了 从没有人攻陷过那城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy. No one has taken that castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.03,1:03:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 总有第一次 - 我们可以出其不意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's always a first time. - We'll have the element of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.63,1:03:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是在这我们有优势！ - 如果我们继续挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we have the advantage here! - If we dig in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.60,1:03:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以长时间拖延他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could probably hold them off indefinitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.31,1:03:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得地下更安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, for one, feel safer underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.31,1:03:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 我很欣赏你在这所做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. I appreciate what you've done here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.51,1:03:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这不是一个堡垒 而是坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this isn't a fortress. It's a tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.15,1:03:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 如果台尔玛人聪明的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. And if they're smart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.78,1:03:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会跟我们打持久战 把我们饿死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Telmarines will just wait and starve us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.72,1:04:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以收集坚果！ - 是啊！然后扔向台尔玛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We could collect nuts! - Yes! And throw them at the Telmarines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.66,1:04:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.86,1:04:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该知道我的立场 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know where I stand, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.57,1:04:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我把你的军队带进去 你能解决守卫吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I get your troops in, can you handle the guards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.84,1:04:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誓死完成 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or die trying, my liege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.14,1:04:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这正是我所担心的 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I'm worried about. - Sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.85,1:04:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们表现得就如只有两条路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all acting like there's only two options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.85,1:04:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么死在这 要么死在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dying here, or dying there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.46,1:04:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不确定你是不是在听 - 不 你没在听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not sure you've been listening. - No, you're not listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.33,1:04:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你们忘了是谁 最后打败了白雪女巫的 彼得?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or have you forgotten who really defeated the White Witch, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.06,1:04:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们等阿斯兰够久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've waited for Aslan long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.74,1:08:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.69,1:09:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我得找到他 - 你没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to find him. - You don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.60,1:09:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你必须去把门打开 - 没有他 你不会在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need to get the gate open. - You wouldn't be here without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.57,1:09:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither would I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.11,1:09:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩能搞定米拉兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I can deal with Miraz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.97,1:09:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍能按时到大门那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can still get to the gate in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.74,1:09:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我是只老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.03,1:10:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我们都希望是个个子高点的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were expecting someone, you know, taller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.83,1:10:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你在说话啊 - 那是在挖苦人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're one to talk. - Is that supposed to be irony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.51,1:10:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有五分钟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five more minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.28,1:10:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.45,1:10:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你逃跑 不是为了让你闯进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't help you escape just so you could break back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.12,1:10:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在米拉兹发现你之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.85,1:10:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你快点离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before Miraz learns you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.39,1:10:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很快就会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to learn soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.23,1:10:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把他扔进你的牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are giving him your cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.06,1:10:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要像你父亲一样低估米拉兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't underestimate Miraz as your father did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.84,1:10:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.14,1:10:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.26,1:11:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank goodness you're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.76,1:11:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.47,1:11:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 凯斯宾? - 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Caspian? - Stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.30,1:11:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在干什么? - 很明显啊 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - I should think it's obvious, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.91,1:11:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 有些家庭会认为这是种不当行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, some families might consider this inappropriate behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.01,1:11:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来这不能阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't seem to have stopped you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.28,1:11:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你跟我不像 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you are not like me, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.28,1:11:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真悲哀 第一次你那么有骨气…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sad. The first time you've shown any backbone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.19,1:11:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…却还是可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it's such a waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.86,1:11:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把剑放下 凯斯宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the sword down, Caspian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.70,1:11:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想这样做 - 我们也不想你这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to do this. - We don't want you to either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.77,1:12:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这以前是个私人房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This used to be a private room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.47,1:12:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?你应该在警卫室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? You're supposed to be in the gatehouse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.81,1:12:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.98,1:12:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就今晚 我要知道真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight for once, I want the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.48,1:12:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你杀了我父亲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.02,1:12:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在进入正题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.63,1:12:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你哥哥死于睡梦中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said your brother died in his sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.06,1:12:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那或许是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was more or less true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.06,1:12:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯宾 这么做没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caspian, this won't make things any better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们台尔玛人如果不抢 就什么也不会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We Telmarines would have nothing had we not taken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.40,1:12:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲明白这点 其他人也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father knew that as well as anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.57,1:12:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.18,1:12:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你射箭一样的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the same reason you will pull that trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.88,1:12:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为了我们的儿子 - 住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For our son. - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.91,1:12:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 呆那别动 - 你得做个选择 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay right there. - You need to make a choice, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.82,1:12:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想让我们的孩子成为国王吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want our child to be king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.22,1:12:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你想让他跟凯斯宾一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do you want him to be like Caspian here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.36,1:12:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有父亲！ - 不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fatherless! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.00,1:13:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯宾！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caspian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.46,1:13:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.27,1:13:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们受到攻击了！ - 敲警钟！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're under attack! - Sound the alarm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.90,1:13:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们！拿起你们的弓！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men! Grab your bows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.28,1:13:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 彼得！ - 我们的军队就在外面！快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter! - Our troops are just outside! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.22,1:13:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 埃德！动手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Ed! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.65,1:13:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给军队发信号 - 我顾不过来 彼得！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Signal the troops! - I'm a bit busy, Pete!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.81,1:14:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得！太迟了！ 我们必须取消行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter! It's too late. We have to call it off while we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.18,1:14:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 还能做！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can still do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.85,1:14:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么做到底是为了谁 彼得?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly who are you doing this for, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.28,1:14:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.22,1:15:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.56,1:15:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们受到攻击了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.40,1:15:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进攻！进攻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack! Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.72,1:15:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了纳尼亚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Narnia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.03,1:16:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弓箭手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.07,1:16:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选中目标！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick a target!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.04,1:16:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take aim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.72,1:16:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃德！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.01,1:17:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that gate closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.40,1:18:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须撤退！立刻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to retreat! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.58,1:18:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去！把她带走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Get her out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.52,1:18:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到大门那！快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the gate! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.76,1:19:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 凯斯宾！ - 我会找到他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Caspian! - I'll find him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.36,1:19:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走！出去！快走！出去！撤退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Get out! Go! Get out! Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.37,1:19:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.87,1:19:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.85,1:19:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人还在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men are still down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.35,1:20:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去！离开这！撤退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw back! Get out! Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.52,1:20:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.53,1:20:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.15,1:20:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑！保住性命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for your life! Save yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.20,1:20:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得！吊桥！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter! The bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.45,1:21:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别管我们！走吧 兄弟们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us! Go, brothers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.95,1:21:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以阿斯兰之名！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of Aslan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.28,1:22:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.21,1:22:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.58,1:22:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 彼得 - 我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter. - Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.15,1:22:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以取消计划的 还有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've called it off. There was still time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.86,1:22:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没时间了 都是因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there wasn't, thanks to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.59,1:22:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果按原计划进行 那些士兵可以存活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you kept to the plan, those soldiers might be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.49,1:22:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你听我的话留在这里 他们肯定能活！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd stayed here like I suggested, they definitely would be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.36,1:22:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你叫我们的 记得吗? - 那是我第一个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You called us, remember? - My first mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.37,1:22:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你的第一个错误是 自以为能领导这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Your first mistake was thinking you could lead these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.91,1:22:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢下纳尼亚的人不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not the one who abandoned Narnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.48,1:22:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你入侵了纳尼亚 比起米拉兹 你更没资格统治它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You invaded Narnia. You have no more right to lead it than Miraz does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.98,1:22:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 他 还有你父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, him, your father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.55,1:22:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你们这种人纳尼亚会更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Narnia's better off without the lot of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.99,1:22:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.53,1:23:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都围着干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you all standing around for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.47,1:23:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,台尔玛人很快就会到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telmarines will be here soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.84,1:23:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你…我亲爱的小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you... my dear little friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.12,1:24:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小伙子们 干得好 - 伙计 太慢了！动作快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well done, lads. - Move it faster, mate. Too slow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.50,1:24:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝鲁那的军队集结完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beruna pledges its troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伽尔玛的军队集结完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galma pledges its troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.14,1:24:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塔什班的军队集结完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tashbaan pledges its troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.11,1:24:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾汀斯莫的军队集结完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ettinsmoor pledges its troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.41,1:24:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国王万岁！ 国王万岁！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king! Long live the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.97,1:25:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拥有那魔法号角 你现在很开心吧 小子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you so glad of that magic horn now, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.21,1:25:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的国王和女王令我们失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your kings and queens have failed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.48,1:25:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的军队已死伤过半 剩下的也时日无多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your army's half dead. And those that aren't will be soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.28,1:25:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么?恭贺?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? Congratulations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.29,1:25:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要你叔叔的鲜血 我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want your uncle's blood. So do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.29,1:25:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要他的王位吗?我们可以帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want his throne? We can get it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.45,1:26:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你尝试了一种古老的力量 但失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried one ancient power. It failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.92,1:26:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但仍然有更强大的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is a power greater still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.96,1:26:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种甚至能牵制住阿斯兰近百年的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that kept even Aslan at bay for near a hundred years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.81,1:26:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.18,1:26:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am hunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.82,1:26:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我渴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.22,1:26:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以禁食一百年…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can fast a hundred years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.16,1:26:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…而不死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and not die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.59,1:26:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以躺在冰上一百年…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can lie a hundred nights on the ice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.06,1:26:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…而不冻僵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and not freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.67,1:27:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以喝光一条河的血而不溃决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can drink a river of blood and not burst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.74,1:27:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看 …你的敌人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me... your enemies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.01,1:27:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你憎恨什么 我们也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you hate, so will we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.28,1:27:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人比我们更心存仇恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one hates better than us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.75,1:27:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以…保证米拉兹会死吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can... guarantee Miraz's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.26,1:27:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.34,1:27:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画圈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the circle be drawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.95,1:28:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.92,1:29:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't what I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.19,1:29:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要亚当的一滴血 就可以解封我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One drop of Adam's blood and you free me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.29,1:29:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会臣服于你 我的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I am yours, my king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.33,1:29:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.72,1:29:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.30,1:30:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来吧！过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.07,1:30:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离他远点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.04,1:30:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.18,1:30:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.18,1:30:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.08,1:30:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要一滴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.09,1:30:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你独自一人完成不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you can't do this alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.75,1:31:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 你搞定它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. You had it sorted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.57,1:32:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你从不告诉我父亲的事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you never tell me about my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.24,1:32:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲是北部山区的一个黑矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother was a Black Dwarf from the Northern Mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.52,1:32:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些年来我冒着生命危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I risked my life all these years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.99,1:32:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了有朝一日…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that one day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.72,1:32:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…你能成为有史以来最伟大的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you might be a better king than those before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.43,1:32:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I have failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.34,1:32:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉过你的事 还有没有告诉过你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything I told you, everything I didn't,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.24,1:32:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都只是因为我相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was only because I believe in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.21,1:32:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会成为史上 最崇高 最不一样的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a chance to become the most noble contradiction in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为拯救纳尼亚的那个台尔玛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Telmarine who saved Narnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.65,1:33:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 你很幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.35,1:33:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.89,1:33:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To have seen him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.93,1:33:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他能给我点证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish he'd just given me some sort of proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.47,1:33:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们才应该给他证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we're the ones who need to prove ourselves to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.18,1:33:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你快过来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete. You'd better come quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.07,1:35:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛋糕与铜鼓 那就是你下一步大计?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cakes and kettledrums. That's your next big plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.58,1:35:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把一个小女孩送到森林最黑暗的角落? 让她独自一人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sending a little girl into the darkest parts of the forest? Alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.42,1:35:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我们唯一的机会 - 我们不会丢下她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's our only chance. - And she won't be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.42,1:35:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死的人还不够多吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't enough of us died already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.29,1:35:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼卡布瑞克也是我的朋友 但他失去希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikabrik was my friend too. But he lost hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.47,1:35:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西女王还心存希望 我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen Lucy hasn't. And neither have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.57,1:35:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了阿斯兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Aslan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.60,1:35:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了阿斯兰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Aslan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.08,1:35:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我跟你们一起去 - 不 这里需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then I'm going with you. - No. We need you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.75,1:35:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在露西和苏珊回来前 我们得拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hold them off until Lucy and Susan get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.75,1:35:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.99,1:35:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米拉兹或许是一个暴君 一个凶手…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miraz may be a tyrant and a murderer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.90,1:35:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…但作为一国之君 他遵从传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but as king, he is subject to the traditions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.74,1:36:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…和人民的期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and expectations of his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.67,1:36:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个计划 或许能为我们争取点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one in particular that may buy us some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.79,1:36:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能想投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps they intend to surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.52,1:36:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.56,1:36:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们太骄矜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are much too noble for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.30,1:36:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“通过选拔与征服 蒙阿斯兰恩赐 我 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I, Peter, by the gift of Aslan, by election and by conquest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.83,1:36:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳尼亚至高王 卡尔帕斯维尔统治者 孤岛君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High King of Narnia, Lord of Cair Paravel and emperor of the Lone Islands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.07,1:36:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了避免令人憎恶的流血事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to prevent the abominable effusion of blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.28,1:36:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在此挑战篡夺者米拉兹 在战场上一对一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do hereby challenge the usurper Miraz to single combat upon the field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.95,1:36:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至死方休 输者将完全臣服”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight shall be to the death. The reward shall be total surrender."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.09,1:36:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我 埃德蒙王子… - 国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me, Prince Edmund... - King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.49,1:36:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再说一遍? - 应该是埃德蒙国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pardon me? - It's King Edmund, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.80,1:37:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是“国王”而已 彼得才是至高王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just "King," though. Peter's the high king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.43,1:37:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这会令人混淆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, it's confusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.97,1:37:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们要冒险接受你的提议?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would we risk such a proposal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.91,1:37:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的军队黄昏前就可以铲平你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when our armies could wipe you out by nightfall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.35,1:37:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不早就低估了我们的数量了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you already underestimated our numbers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.98,1:37:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 一星期前 纳尼亚人就灭绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, only a week ago Narnians were extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.09,1:37:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会步他们的后尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so you will be again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.36,1:37:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就没什么好害怕的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you should have little to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.53,1:37:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是勇不勇敢的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a question of bravery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.70,1:37:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是勇敢地拒绝跟一个 只有你一半年纪的军人决斗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're bravely refusing to fight a swordsman half your age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.44,1:37:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说我拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say I refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.67,1:37:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下 无论你决定怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall have our support, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.21,1:37:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever your decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.08,1:37:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阁下 我们的军事优势 足以给我们理由去避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sire, our military advantage alone provides the perfect excuse to avoid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.15,1:37:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有可能造成… - 我不会逃避什么！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- what might otherwise be... - I'm not avoiding anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.82,1:37:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是指出而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was merely pointing out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.52,1:38:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下您有权拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my lord is well within his rights to refuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.42,1:38:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下从来不会拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His Majesty would never refuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.03,1:38:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很珍惜这样一个向人民展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He relishes the chance to show the people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.83,1:38:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新国王勇气的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the courage of their new king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.30,1:38:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.31,1:38:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好指望你哥哥的剑 比他的笔尖更锋利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should hope your brother's sword is sharper than his pen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.62,1:38:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德斯瑞尔一直是我的好坐骑 你们有了个好帮手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destrier has always served me well. You are in good hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.09,1:38:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是好“帮蹄”吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or hooves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.43,1:38:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 祝你好运 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.77,1:38:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.41,1:38:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你该拿回这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it is time you had this back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.31,1:39:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不留着它 或许你还要召唤我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you hold on to it. You might need to call me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.82,1:39:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 或许你还要召唤我的? - 哦 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You might need to call me again? - Oh, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.07,1:40:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况不太妙的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it should appear to be going poorly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.85,1:40:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.46,1:40:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我胜出的时候 你们不会太失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you won't be too disappointed when I survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.17,1:40:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在投降还来得及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is still time to surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.10,1:41:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, feel free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.11,1:41:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了王位还要死多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more must die for the throne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.58,1:41:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.60,1:41:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跑！ - 他们看到我们了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ride! - They've seen us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.19,1:41:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓住缰绳 - 你要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take the reins. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.49,1:41:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 露西 看来最后你还是得一个人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Lucy. But it looks as if you'll be going alone after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.74,1:43:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不需要那个号角了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you don't need that horn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.95,1:44:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殿下需要中场休息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does His Highness need a respite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.62,1:44:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.56,1:44:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三分钟！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.24,1:45:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.05,1:45:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她过去了…得到了一点帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got through... with a little help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.48,1:45:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 你在忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Well, you were busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.52,1:45:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你不会让他们再次靠近！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you won't let things get that close again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.40,1:45:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好到上面去 以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get up there. Just in case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.53,1:45:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不指望台尔玛人会守信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't expect the Telmarines will keep their word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.81,1:45:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.34,1:45:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.31,1:45:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep smiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.39,1:45:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does he look to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.96,1:45:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.13,1:46:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但以年纪来看…陛下做得很好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But His Majesty's doing extremely well... for his age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.85,1:46:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是脱臼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's dislocated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.02,1:46:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你死在这里 家那边会怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think happens back home if you die here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.49,1:46:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在帮我 可我却从未真正…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you've always been there, and I never really...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.70,1:46:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍后再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save it for later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.24,1:48:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.28,1:48:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.45,1:48:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 现在不是秀骑士精神的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now's not the time for chivalry, Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.92,1:48:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要手软！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show no mercy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.44,1:48:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.90,1:49:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 小子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.44,1:49:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人都不敢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too cowardly to take a life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.65,1:49:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不该由我来杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not mine to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.06,1:50:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.69,1:50:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你确实有资格成为台尔玛国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you do have the makings of a Telmarine king after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.75,1:50:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会像你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.12,1:50:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,饶你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.13,1:50:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我会把纳尼亚人的王国归还给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am giving the Narnians back their kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.69,1:51:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.23,1:51:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完事后再找你算账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll deal with you when this is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.40,1:51:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.92,1:51:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,背信弃义！他们射死了陛下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treachery! They shot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.26,1:51:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀害了我们的国王！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They murdered our king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.50,1:52:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全体准备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.30,1:52:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.07,1:52:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.02,1:52:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举起武器 台尔玛！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To arms, Telmar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.29,1:52:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举起武器！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.23,1:52:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.79,1:52:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑兵准备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cavalry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.19,1:53:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进攻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.51,1:53:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弓箭手准备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archers to the ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.60,1:53:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳尼亚人准备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Narnians!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.44,1:53:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进攻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.99,1:54:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.23,1:54:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三 四…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, four...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.77,1:54:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五 六…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.97,1:54:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举弓！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your aim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.14,1:54:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准他们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.81,1:54:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八 九…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight, nine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.05,1:54:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.72,1:54:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.58,1:55:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下！后退！后退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Back! Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.01,1:55:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稳住！稳住！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it now! Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.85,1:55:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.60,1:55:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.19,1:55:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.61,1:56:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是只老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.38,1:56:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人真没想象力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You people have no imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.38,1:56:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射 发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loose! Loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.26,1:56:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.70,1:57:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撤回堡垒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the How!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.54,1:57:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让他们逃了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut off their escape!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.11,1:57:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.21,1:57:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.39,1:57:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.06,1:57:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撤回堡垒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the How!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.48,1:58:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部砸烂它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crush them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.98,1:59:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.56,1:59:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是你 一直都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it was you. The whole time, I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.00,1:59:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但其他人不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the others didn't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.30,1:59:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们不相信你 你就不来找我呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would that stop you from coming to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.60,1:59:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我害怕自己一个人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I was too scared to come alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.38,2:00:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不现身?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't you show yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.51,2:00:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不像上次那样 咆哮而来拯救我们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why couldn't you come roaring in and save us like last time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.81,2:00:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 事不过二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things never happen the same way twice, dear one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.42,2:00:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我早点来 死了的人… 我就能阻止吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'd have come earlier, would everyone who died... could I have stopped that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.60,2:00:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西 我们永远无法知道如果的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can never know what would have happened, Lucy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.73,2:00:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但将要发生什么却完全是另一码事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what will happen is another matter entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.10,2:00:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你意思是你会出手帮助? - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean you'll help? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.64,2:00:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你也会的 - 哦 我希望当时我能勇敢些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As will you. - Oh, I wish I was braver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.34,2:00:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你更勇敢的话就成了头母狮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were any braver, you'd be a lioness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.31,2:00:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你的朋友们睡得够久了 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I think your friends have slept long enough, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.28,2:01:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.15,2:02:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,露西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.81,2:02:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了阿斯兰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Aslan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.59,2:02:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们把他们引到河边 就能打败他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can defeat them if we draw them to the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.52,2:03:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须重整队伍 去贝鲁那！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must regroup. To Beruna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.59,2:03:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去桥那！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.55,2:04:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.38,2:04:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.35,2:04:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大浪！ - 撤退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The river! - Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.39,2:04:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后！退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back! Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.48,2:05:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.68,2:06:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在河岸集合！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assemble on that bank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.35,2:06:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会伤害你们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not be harmed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.29,2:06:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交出武器！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrender your weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.46,2:06:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卸下盔甲！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off the armor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.78,2:06:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 纳尼亚的国王和女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise, kings and queens of Narnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.99,2:06:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.89,2:06:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think I am ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.89,2:07:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正因为这个原因 我认为你已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for that very reason I know you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.55,2:07:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.35,2:07:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.59,2:08:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰万岁！ 真是荣幸 能够…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail, Aslan! It is a great honor to be in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.53,2:08:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,形象全毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm completely out of countenance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.30,2:08:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我如此不体面地出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must crave your indulgence for appearing in this unseemly fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.04,2:08:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一滴如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a drop more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.17,2:08:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我觉得那没用 - 你可以试一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think it does that. - You could have a go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.61,2:08:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它让你活了 小东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It becomes you well, small one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.41,2:08:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全同意 伟大的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the same, great king,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.31,2:08:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我要引退了 因为尾巴对老鼠来说是尊严和荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret that I must withdraw, for a tail is the honor and glory of a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.85,2:08:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 或许你把尊严看得太重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you think too much of your honor, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.42,2:08:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是尊严问题 它对平衡也很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not just the honor. It's also great for balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.36,2:08:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有攀爬 抓东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And climbing. And grabbing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.00,2:08:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅 陛下 我们无法忍受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May it please Your High Majesty, we will not bear the shame{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.44,2:08:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种有毁领袖尊严的耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of wearing an honor denied to our chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.51,2:08:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不是为了你的尊严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for the sake of your dignity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.01,2:08:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是为了你对人民的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but for the love of your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.28,2:09:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看！谢谢 陛下 我会永远珍惜它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Thank you, my liege. I will treasure it always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.86,2:09:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从今天开始 它将时刻提醒我这次巨大的耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From this day forward it will serve as a great reminder of my huge humility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.63,2:09:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你们经常跟我提起的 那个小朋友呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where is this dear little friend you've told me so much about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.85,2:09:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你看到他了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see him now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.85,2:10:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们是溜进来的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you have snuck in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.89,2:10:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 但他们在那个世界的 未来是美好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but their future in that world shall be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.96,2:10:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.71,2:11:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好了 大家都集合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are ready. Everyone has assembled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.52,2:11:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳尼亚属于纳尼亚人 也属于人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Narnia belongs to the Narnians, just as it does to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.99,2:11:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎任何想留下和平共处的台尔玛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any Telmarines who want to stay and live in peace are welcome to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.33,2:11:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们想的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for any of you who wish,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.76,2:11:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯兰会把你们送回我们祖先的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aslan will return you to the home of our forefathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.47,2:11:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开台尔玛已经有几代了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been generations since we left Telmar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.57,2:11:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所说的不是台尔玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not referring to Telmar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.04,2:11:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的祖先曾是搁浅在一座岛上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ancestors were seafaring brigands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.81,2:11:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海贼和海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirates run aground on an island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.58,2:11:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在那发现了一个山洞 罕见的裂口把他们从自己的世界带到了这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they found a cave, a rare chasm that brought them here from their world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.78,2:11:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的国王和女王也来自同一个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same world as our kings and queens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.09,2:11:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把你们送回那座岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is to that island I can return you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.59,2:11:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对于任何想重新开始的人来说 那是个好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a good place for any who wish to make a new start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.73,2:12:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.17,2:12:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受这个建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will accept the offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.64,2:12:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So will we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.65,2:12:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们最先报名 你们在那个世界将会有个幸福的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you have spoken first, your future in that world shall be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.23,2:13:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们去了哪里? - 被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did they go? - They killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.43,2:13:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么知道他不是让我们去送死呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know he is not leading us to our death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.24,2:13:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下 如果我的示范能起作用的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sire. If my example can be of any service,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.87,2:13:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意立刻带十一只老鼠进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take 11 mice through with no delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.78,2:13:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们也去 - 我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll go. - We will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.79,2:13:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Our time's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.46,2:13:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.80,2:13:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…这里不需要我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're not really needed here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.80,2:13:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你保管着 直到你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will look after it until you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.34,2:13:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕就到此为止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that's just it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.38,2:13:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.31,2:14:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.18,2:14:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.72,2:14:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少 我认为他是指你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, I think he means you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.32,2:14:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.36,2:14:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们做错了什么? - 亲爱的 正好相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did they do something wrong? - Quite the opposite, dear one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.69,2:14:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但万物都有它的期限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all things have their time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.73,2:14:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的哥哥和姐姐已经在这个世界 学到了他们要学的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother and sister have learned what they can from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.27,2:14:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是时候让他们回到自己的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's time for them to live in their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.97,2:14:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情会好起来的 露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Lu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.44,2:14:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切并不如我想的那样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not how I thought it would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.38,2:14:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…但这没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.85,2:14:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你也会明白 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day you'll see, too. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.82,2:15:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad I came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.26,2:15:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我们能有更多时间在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish we had more time together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.79,2:15:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之那是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would never have worked, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.23,2:15:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.00,2:15:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比你老了一千三百岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am 1,300 years older than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.19,2:15:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定 当我老了我会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure when I'm older I'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.39,2:15:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比你老 但我才不想明白呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm older and don't think I want to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.91,2:17:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲利斯 你不上车吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you coming, Phyllis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:23.72,2:17:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们没有其他办法回去了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think there's any way we can get back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.19,2:17:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把我的新手电筒留在纳尼亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've left my new torch in Narnia.{\r}
